{"id":"a556f16d9432aae2","group":"58","path":"58/batch02/58-df-hom.md","title":"Hom Set","display":"df-hom — Hom Set","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-hom","aliases":["58-df-hom","Hom Set"],"display":"df-hom — Hom Set","depends_on":["[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-hom"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-hom</span><span>Hom Set</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-hom — Hom Set"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\">\\(C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(C)\">\\(\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(C)\\)</span>（see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8790486ac053461c\" href=\"?note=8790486ac053461c\" title=\"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md\">../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md</a>）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in C_0\">\\(A,B\\in C_0\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}_C(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}_C(A,B)\\)</span>（本文件定义的从 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 到 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的态射集）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hom} \\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(C)\\land A,B\\in C_0\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Hom}_C(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in C_1:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=B\\}\n\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hom} \\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(C)\\land A,B\\in C_0\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Hom}_C(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in C_1:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=B\\}\n\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Hom set: arrows whose source is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> and target is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> in the explicitly given category structure.</li>\n<li>Locally small: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}(A,B)\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}(A,B)\\)</span> always a set; big otherwise (quasicategory)</li>\n<li>Representable functor: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Hom}(A, -): C \\to Set\">\\(\\operatorname{Hom}(A, -): C \\to Set\\)</span>; Yoneda lemma</li>\n<li>Enriched: Hom in <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>-category is object of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span>; hom objects in monoidal category</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mac Lane, Categories for the Working Mathematician</li>\n<li>Awodey, Category Theory</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md","status":"resolved","id":"8790486ac053461c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle$ 且 $\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(C)$（see [[../batch03/58-df-category-theory.md]]）","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C=\\langle C_0,C_1,s,t,\\circ,e\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(C)","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in C_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}_C(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}hom} \\vdash\n\\left(\n\\mathrm{CategoryStructure}_S(C)\\land A,B\\in C_0\n\\right)\n\\to\n\\left(\n\\operatorname{Hom}_C(A,B)\\coloneqq\\{f\\in C_1:s(f)=A\\land t(f)=B\\}\n\\right)","display":true},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}(A,B)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Hom}(A, -): C \\to Set","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false}],"bytes":1124,"backlinks":[{"id":"be043eb55dfff728","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-hom.md]])"},{"id":"8d3eef48d90e1884","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{Hom}_{(-)}:V^3\\rightharpoonup V$ (see [[../batch02/58-df-hom.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-144","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-hom]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-633","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-hom.md|58-df-hom]]（batch02）"}],"outgoing":["8790486ac053461c"]}